    Review -->|Confirm| Confirmed[Confirmation]
    Confirmed -->|Go to Today| Today
    Today -->|Adjust today| Plan
    Today -->|Review day| ReviewToday[Review today]
    ReviewToday -->|Keep or move unfinished work| Tomorrow[Plan tomorrow]
    Today -->|Plan tomorrow| Tomorrow
    Tomorrow -->|Review| Review
